+// REWINDBOX_ZCULL_WAIT_GUARD_627: Build 624 logs (PID 1893). With the labels on their own
+// page (624) the lever served only real report reads: Assassin's Creed window 9, 99 reads,
+// 9.6 ms each (0.02 ms pickup), the RSX thread blocked 0.95 s of 5 s, 57 FPS at 18 draws per frame. TaskThread1 then
+// waited 548/564/610 ms in three seconds and the lever tripped; the rest of the boot ran the
